node IMG 13.444 45.206 19.307 4.958 "Wing image\l\l• Standard: tif / tiff / bmp / png / jpg / jpeg\l• Adobe: psd / psb\l• Modern: heic / heif / svg\l• Camera \
RAW: dng / nef / cr2 / cr3 / arw / raf / orf / pef / rw2 / srw / raw\l• Microscopy: czi / nd2 / lif / lsm (→ OME-TIFF)\l" rounded,filled ellipse #c8862a #fde6c4
node WING_MODEL 28.833 45.206 10.129 2.4242 "Wing isolation model dir\l\l• weights + metadata.json (optional)\l" rounded,filled ellipse #4a6fa5 #e8eef7
node LMK_MODEL 39.042 45.206 9.6726 2.4242 "Landmark model\l\l• ResNet18 U-Net checkpoint (.pt)\l" rounded,filled ellipse #4a6fa5 #e8eef7
node SEG_MODEL 47.958 45.206 7.5366 2.4242 "Segmentation model dir\l\l• weights + metadata.json\l" rounded,filled ellipse #4a6fa5 #e8eef7
node CONFIG 54.347 45.206 4.6345 2.4242 "PipelineConfig\l\l• JSON / GUI\l" rounded,filled ellipse #4a6fa5 #e8eef7
node P1 30.639 39.799 12.038 2.9954 "Stage 1: Resolution adjust\l\l• Compare input µm/px to model's training µm/px\l• Skip if ratio is inside tolerance band\l• \
Otherwise rescale image toward target µm/px\l• Geometry is inverse-rescaled after Stage 2 (identifyFeatures)\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P2 19.736 39.799 8.5479 3.0788 "Stage 2: Wing isolation (optional)\l\l• Run wing-isolation model → wing polygon\l• Buffer polygon by wing_expand_fraction\l• \
Mask non-wing pixels to 0\l• Write isolated image + wing.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P3 28.875 34.954 7.1208 3.5058 "Stage 3: Landmark detection\l\l• Load LandmarkPredictor (cached)\l• Heatmap regression inference\l• Extract peak coordinates\l• \
Map names → GeoJSON schema\l• Write landmarks.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P4 20.069 34.954 9.8708 3.4225 "Stage 4: Hinge chop\l\l• Load landmarks from Stage 3\l• Build hinge polyline from distal-margin landmarks\l• Build proximal \
mask\l• Black out hinge pixels (in place, no translation)\l• Write chopped image (temp)\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P5 48.611 34.954 11.183 5.2975 "Stage 5: Segmentation\l\l• Load seg model + metadata (cached)\l• Read RGB uint8\l• Tiled inference w/ center-crop stitch\l• \
Optional ROI from wing.geojson (skips background tiles)\l• Per-channel normalization\l• Gaussian smooth probabilities\l• Argmax \
→ class mask\l• Polygonize mask → features\l• Save detection.geojson\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node P6 37.722 34.954 9.975 2.9954 "Stage 6: Wing rotation (optional)\l\l• Fit affine from reliable landmarks\l• Rotate un-masked image to canonical orientation\l• \
Apply same affine to every produced GeoJSON\l• Optional mirror-correct for opposite-chirality wings\l" rounded,filled box #3c8c4f #e6f4ea
node WING_GJ 22.069 29.562 8.8919 2.4242 "wing.geojson\l\l• single 'wing' feature (Stage 2)\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node LMK_GJ 14.444 29.562 5.7541 2.4242 "landmarks.geojson\l\l• Point features\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node CHOPPED 32.875 29.562 12.118 2.4242 "chopped image\l\l• temp; deleted unless --keep-intermediates\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node SEG_GJ 43.069 29.562 7.6692 2.4242 "detection.geojson\l\l• vein + intervein polygons\l" rounded,filled ellipse #b38a1b #fff7e0
node I1 18.167 24.781 6.2354 2.9954 "Step 1: Parse inputs\l\l• Load vein / intervein polys\l• Snap raw landmarks\l• Compute wing outline (union)\l• Estimate \
image_shape\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I2 26.194 24.781 7.9125 4.36 "Step 2: Build skeleton graph\l\l• Rasterize vein polys → vein_mask\l• Boundary smoothing (optional)\l• Skeletonize (RIDGE / \
medial-axis / …)\l• Prune (distance-map / multi-scale)\l• Collinear edge merge\l• Gap bridging — pass 1 / 2 / 3\l• Compute \
median_vein_width_px\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I3 25.208 18.249 7.6313 2.5683 "Step 3: Anchor landmarks\l\l• Snap each landmark to nearest node\l• Junction vs endpoint preference\l• Store snap_distance\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I4 16.347 18.249 6.7458 2.1412 "Step 4: Compute wing axis\l\l• Proximal / distal from landmarks\l• Unit vector + length\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I5 25.208 13.743 7.1521 5.1308 "Step 5: Call veins\l\l• Merge through crossvein junctions\l• Detect costa (margin band)\l• Propagate labels through deg-2\l• \
Extend to distal landmarks\l• Detect L6\l• Detect crossveins (ACV / PCV)\l• Label ectopic veins (EV*)\l• Assign tissue polys (\
buffer vw)\l• h-maxima split of intervein polys\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I6 16.958 13.743 6.5167 2.9954 "Step 6: Call intervein regions\l\l• Buffer vein centerlines\l• Match bounding-vein sets\l• Tie-break by wing-axis position\l• \
Absorb tiny fragments\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node MM 14.792 21.067 11.152 2.5683 "measurementMaker: custom distances\l\l• User-defined landmark-pair distances\l• Augments batch CSV with custom_<label>_um columns\l• \
Fast path: emits CSV without running identifyFeatures\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node WR 25.208 7.528 14.991 4.2362 "WingResult\l\l• veins: list[VeinIdentification]\l• intervein_regions: list[InterveinRegion]\l• landmarks, wing_outline, warnings\l• \
